src="/assets/photos/kuapapoh-expo-shelf.webp" alt="Gold-framed works displayed on an old wooden shelf in the 
exhibition." loading="lazy" width="1050" height="1400"><figcaption><span>Gold-framed works displayed on an old wooden 
shelf in the exhibition.</span><span class="credit">Kuapapoh project · Ji Show 
Muang</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="story-gallery-card"><img 
src="/assets/photos/kuapapoh-artist-card.webp" alt="The exhibition’s About the Artist biography card for Peranakan 
Charm." loading="lazy" width="926" height="1400"><figcaption><span>The exhibition’s About the Artist biography card 
for Peranakan Charm.</span><span class="credit">Kuapapoh project · Ji Show 
Muang</span></figcaption></figure></div></section></section><details class="unknowns-box-v2"><summary>Missing 
data</summary><ul><li>The historical background of Peranakan clothing in Takua Pa</li><li>Official attendance and 
economic impact</li><li>The schedule after September 2026</li></ul></details><section 
